      428.18
    ],
    "text": "FISHERIES AND AQUATIC RESOURCES ACT, No. 2 OF 1996",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      441.25,
      539.87,
      476.32
    ],
    "text": "REGULATIONS made by the Minister of Agriculture, Rural Economic Affairs, Livestock Development, Irrigation andFisheries and Aquactic Resources Development under Section 61 (1)(sa) and (sb) of the Fisheries and Aquatic ResourcesAct, No. 2 of 1996.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      489.25,
      533.52,
      560.32
    ],
    "text": "P. HARRISON,Minister of Agriculture, Rural Economic Affairs,Livestock Development, Irrigation and Fisheries andAquatic Resoures Development.Colombo,05th June, 2019.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      266.85,
      573.25,
      320.85,
      584.32
    ],
    "text": "Regulations",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      597.25,
      539.9,
      620.32
    ],
    "text": "1. These regulations may be cited as the Issuance of Certificates of Competence for Skippers (Local FishingBoard) Regulations, 2019.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      633.25,
      539.91,
      656.32
    ],
    "text": "2. These regulations shall be applicable to persons who apply to serve as skippers of multiday local fishing boatshaving a length of not less than ten decimal three meters (10.3m).",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      669.25,
      539.95,
      716.32
    ],
    "text": "3. No person shall serve as a skipper in a multiday local fishing boat having aforementioned specificationswithout obtaining a Certificate of Competence issued by the Director-General of the Department of Fisheries and AquaticResources (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cDirector-General\u201d) or a coxswain license issued by a recognized maritimetraining institute for the purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      57.19,
      71.89,
      517.38,
      92.85
    ],
    "text": "I fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'06'03PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 03.06.20192A",
    "fonts": [
      "FMAbabld,Bold",
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.599999904632568,
      8.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      91.15,
      101.65,
      446.98,
      112.72
    ],
    "text": "4. Any person applying for a Cetificate of Comptence referred to in regulation 3 shall-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      97.75,
      125.65,
      547.25,
      148.72
    ],
    "text": "(a) not be less than eighteen (18) years of age as at the date on which the relevant written or oral test as thecase may be, is to be held ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      97.15,
      161.65,
      547.2,
      184.72
    ],
    "text": "(b) have, not less than two (2) years experience on a multiday local fishing boat referred to above, at the sea,either as a skipper or as a crew member ; and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      97.15,
      197.65,
      547.19,
      220.72
    ],
    "text": "(c) have completed a fishing vessel skipper training programme of not less than one (1) week duration, in anyrecognized institute approved by the Director - General.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      67.15,
      233.65,
      493.21,
      244.72
    ],
    "text": "5. The application for a Certificate of Competence shall be accompanied by the following documents :-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      97.75,
      257.65,
      547.19,
      280.72
    ],
    "text": "(a) a fitness certificate issued by a recognized medical practioner or a recognized medical institute includingthe hearing and visual state of the applicant ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      97.15,
      293.65,
      463.19,
      304.72
    ],
    "text": "(b) a certificate of competence issued by any one of the following institutions, namely -",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      122.95,
      317.65,
      547.21,
      340.72
    ],
    "text": "(i) Ocean University of Sri Lanka, established under the Ocean University of Sri Lanka Act, No. 31 of2014 ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      119.95,
      353.65,
      547.23,
      376.72
    ],
    "text": "(ii) Colombo International Nautical and Engineering College recognized as a degree awarding instituteunder the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978 ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      116.95,
      389.65,
      517.78,
      400.72
    ],
    "text": "(iii) Mahapola Academy established under the Sri Lanka Ports Authority Act, No. 51 of 1979 ; or",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      118.75,
      413.65,
      432.01,
      424.72
    ],
    "text": "(iv) any other institute recognized for the purpose by the Director-General.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      139.15,
      437.65,
      547.32,
      460.72
    ],
    "text": "certifying that the applicant has undergone training successfully as a skipper in a fishing vessel for aperiod of not less than one (1) week ; and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      85.15,
      473.65,
      547.31,
      508.72
    ],
    "text": "(c) a document or documents to prove that the applicant has undergone sufficient training including methods offishing, sailing, radio communication, personal safety and life saving, fire prevention, fire extinguishing,emergency first aid at the sea, international obligations of high seas fishing and prevention of marine pollution.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      533.65,
      547.25,
      556.72
    ],
    "text": "6. Every application for a Certificate of Competence under these regulations shall be sent, addressed to theDirector-General, and shall be in the form specifed in Schedule I hereto.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      569.65,
      547.3,
      592.72
    ],
    "text": "7. Every eligible applicant shall be informed of the venue and the date of the oral or written test as the case maybe, in writing by the Director-General at least one week before such date.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      605.65,
      547.2,
      628.72
    ],
    "text": "8. The Director-General may, from time to time made amendments to the syllabus applicable to the oral orwritten test as the case may be, to be conducted under these regulations in order to maintain high standards of such test.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      641.65,
      547.27,
      676.72
    ],
    "text": "9. The Director-General shall, upon being satisfied that the candidate has achieved the required standards at theoral or written test as the case may be, issue a certificate of competence to the successful candidate within a period of twoweeks from such test.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      689.65,
      547.25,
      724.72
    ],
    "text": "10. The Director-General shall issue a skipper license in the form specified in Schedule II hereto, to any applicantwho obtained the certificate of competence referred to in regulation 9 upon payment of the license fee referred to inSchedule III hereto.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      79.65,
      71.65,
      539.85,
      92.85
    ],
    "text": "I fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'06'03PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 03.06.20193A",
    "fonts": [
      "FMAbabld,Bold",
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.599999904632568,
      8.0,
